---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const email = site.email || 'janehoudesign@gmail.com';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Migration Dashboard"
  heading="Leading design of 0 → 1 internal tooling"
  role="Product Designer"
  team="1 Product Manager, 3 Developers"
  timeline="March 2026 – Present"
  projectType="Product Design"
  commentId="case-study-migration"
>
  <section id="outline" data-comment-id="migration-outline" class="migration-outline">
    <p class="lead">
      I joined an early-stage, startup-like beta as the sole designer, defining design direction and
      what success looked like for an internal developer tool supporting adoption of Intuit’s unified
      design system.
    </p>
    <p class="lead">
      The product helps engineers and technical program managers make code updates across 10+ teams:
      updating dependencies, swapping hardcoded values for tokens, and more, with agents that discover
      needed fixes and apply the changes.
    </p>
    <p class="lead">
      I led 7 user testing sessions with TPMs and engineers and delivered 3 core feature sets for
      implementation. Early estimates suggest the migration workflows could save about a day per
      customer project, supporting AI-accelerated workflows and design-system adoption.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section data-comment-id="migration-nda">
    <aside class="migration-disclaimer" role="note" aria-label="NDA notice">
      <p>
        I’m not able to publicize this work due to an NDA. If you’d like to learn more, please
        <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>contact me personally</a> for details.
      </p>
    </aside>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>

<style>
  .migration-disclaimer {
    padding: 1rem 0;
    background: transparent;
  }

  .migration-disclaimer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .migration-disclaimer a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.15em;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }

  .migration-disclaimer a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .migration-outline p + p {
    margin-top: 1em;
  }
</style>
